@@ -0,0 +1,17 @@
+---
+"@gpuix/native": patch
+---
+
+Add opt-in native CommonMark/GFM editing with cursor-aware source/display mapping, styled headings and text, lists/tasks/quotes, native images, aligned tables, links/autolinks, code blocks, and viewport scrolling for the local Journal Tree build. Preserve raw HTML as editable text.
+
+Support Tab/Shift-Tab indentation with preserved selections and undo, automatic list continuation on Enter, and removing empty list markers on Enter. Keep Shift-Enter as a plain newline.
+
+Keep empty nested dash bullets from applying setext heading fonts and metrics to the previous item while editing.
+
+Convert typed double hyphens after prose to an em dash with reversible Undo, preserving code, URLs, escapes, and Markdown separators.
+
+Use literal tabs for indentation, render four-column tab stops with source mapping, and keep tab-indented paragraphs and bullets from becoming implicit code blocks.
+
+Render completed unordered bullet prefixes immediately and keep them rendered while typing or continuing lists, preserving editable Markdown source.
+
+Highlight editable fenced code using its language label and the native cached Syntect engine, preserving source offsets, monospace layout, composition, and theme syntax colours.
